        "detailed_description": "<h1>New Roguelite Deckbuilder Mode!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a replayable deckbuilder where you create clever combinations of pilots, drones, and Battle Suit mods. Progress unlocks bits of lore, hundreds of cards, and game-changing ships. On each run, you'll hone a unique deck and take on monsters and nefarious factions. For an exciting challenge, play Daily Runs and and claim your spot on the leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/64078dca5db02c7b511800e2d7999121.poster.avif?t=1787149491\" width=782 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/64078dca5db02c7b511800e2d7999121.webm?t=1787149491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/64078dca5db02c7b511800e2d7999121.mp4?t=1787149491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Battle Suit Aces campaign is a fully-voiced, sci-fi epic that feels like a Saturday morning cartoon with you at the helm. Recruit your pilots, upgrade their battle suits, and command them to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a new threat to the galaxy emerges, Union Command dispatches a ragtag team of pilots and scientists to investigate. Join Captain Heathcliff and his Patchworks crew as they search for powerful Relic Suits in a tale of friendship and belonging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BATTLE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy a wide array of upgradable mecha pilots in card combat. Pair them with energy-generating Drones and potent Command Cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CREW</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and bond with 25 pilots from five powerful factions. Each faction has their own unlockable missions and combat strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the Patchworks crew’s journey across 45 thrilling episodes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All 75 characters are fully-voiced by the incredible cast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 tracks composed by Carlos &quot;insaneintherain&quot; Eiene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lane-based attack patterns and unique card passives form an accessible, deep combat system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for story-driven battles, including surprise attacks, heists, and Starball matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of mods let you customize your ship and cards to build the perfect deck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suit Up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/0abd4fd377b30718bf865807f3283f52.poster.avif?t=1787149491\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/0abd4fd377b30718bf865807f3283f52.webm?t=1787149491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/0abd4fd377b30718bf865807f3283f52.mp4?t=1787149491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Battle Suit Aces campaign is a fully-voiced, sci-fi epic that feels like a Saturday morning cartoon with you at the helm. Recruit your pilots, upgrade their battle suits, and command them to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a new threat to the galaxy emerges, Union Command dispatches a ragtag team of pilots and scientists to investigate. Join Captain Heathcliff and his Patchworks crew as they search for powerful Relic Suits in a tale of friendship and belonging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BATTLE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy a wide array of upgradable mecha pilots in card combat. Pair them with energy-generating Drones and potent Command Cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CREW</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and bond with 25 pilots from five powerful factions. Each faction has their own unlockable missions and combat strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the Patchworks crew’s journey across 45 thrilling episodes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All 75 characters are fully-voiced by the incredible cast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 tracks composed by Carlos &quot;insaneintherain&quot; Eiene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lane-based attack patterns and unique card passives form an accessible, deep combat system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for story-driven battles, including surprise attacks, heists, and Starball matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of mods let you customize your ship and cards to build the perfect deck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suit Up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/0abd4fd377b30718bf865807f3283f52.poster.avif?t=1787149491\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/0abd4fd377b30718bf865807f3283f52.webm?t=1787149491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870530/extras/0abd4fd377b30718bf865807f3283f52.mp4?t=1787149491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Battle Suit Aces is a tactical deckbuilder that can be played as a clever roguelite or epic campaign full of tender moments, cosmic quests, and charming characters.",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
        "reviews": "“A delightful visual novel and a great deckbuilder combined. What more could you want?”<br>PC Gamer<br><br>“Game of the Year contender that mashes up card combat, army building and a whole lot of heart.”<br>Loot Level Chill<br><br>“Battle Suit Aces is a must-have for any fan of the mecha genre or card games, and if you’re in both camps, you’re in for a treat!”<br>Game Grin<br>",
